<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguayan Nov inflation 0.3 pct, vs 1.0 pct '95.</title>
<headline>Paraguayan Nov inflation 0.3 pct, vs 1.0 pct '95.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguay registered inflation of 0.3 percent in November, up from zero in October but below November 1995's 1.0 percent, the Central Bank said Monday.</p>
<p>Inflation was 8.8 percent in the 12 months to the end of November.</p>
<p>-- Jose Maria Amarilla, Asuncion Newsroom +59521 44-4527/8</p>
</text>
